<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">lucky jacket</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Everything fell apart so suddenly. First, the ship was attacked. Then Catra and Adora started arguing. And now Adora is quite literally being huntedâ€”and unable to turn into She-Ra to properly defend herself. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How could it have gone so wrong so quickly? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Of course, Catra knows the answer. Just as Glimmer and Bow had known the answer, and tried to warn her. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The jacket. If Catra hadnâ€™t destroyed Adoraâ€™s stupid lucky jacket, none of this would have happened. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(In other words: A fashion-forward Catra attempts to dispose of Adoraâ€™s crusty-ass Horde jacket. Chaos ensues.)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>chellethewriter</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Melog (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra loves her girlfriend but hates her jacket</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and that's valid</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lesbians in Space!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Declarations Of Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>crack and fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Miscommunication</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>does Adora need luck or therapy? YOU DECIDE</rdf:li>
